  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A prop feature would be cool. Something that lets us upload and locally spawn our own props. I would love to able to e.g upload a prop that is just VRCLens so I can spawn it as its own object, with its own expression menu no matter what avatar im using. \nLocal realtime lights, screen space filters etc. could be created with such a feature. it would be local only so it wouldnt effect the experience for others at all. A lot of creators put features on their avatars that only work locally and could be an individual prop instead. it increases avatar stats for no reason and makes them less flexible for use.\nBeing able to e.g switch avatars but have vrc lens still work and not reset (because its a prop) would be very cool. Hope this makes sense, thank you.",
